{
    "name": "rho",
    "displayName": "Rho",
    "description": "Rho: language support, a debug adapter, and the peripheral view for embedded targets.",
    "version": "0.4.0",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "publisher": "rho-lang",
    "engines": {
        "vscode": "^1.82.0"
    },
    "categories": [
        "Programming Languages"
    ],
    "main": "./out/extension.js",
    "contributes": {
        "languages": [
            {
                "id": "rho",
                "aliases": [
                    "Rho",
                    "rho"
                ],
                "extensions": [
                    ".rho"
                ],
                "configuration": "./language-configuration.json"
            }
        ],
        "grammars": [
            {
                "language": "rho",
                "scopeName": "source.rho",
                "path": "./syntaxes/rho.tmLanguage.json"
            }
        ],
        "configuration": {
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Rho",
            "properties": {
                "rho.lsp.serverPath": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "Where the `rho` toolchain is, **only when it is not where the extension finds it by itself**. The extension checks (1) this setting, (2) `RHO_BIN`, (3) the Rho home (`~/.rho`/`RHO_HOME`), and (4) `PATH`, so a deployed toolchain is found with nothing configured. Set an absolute path here when it is somewhere unusual; a relative path is read from the Rho home."
                },
                "rho.debug.target": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "The board to debug, as its target spec names it (`nucleo-h753zi`, `pico`). **Leave empty to use what the project declares** \u2014 the `target` in the launch configuration `rho ide vscode` writes. It decides the debugger, the probe and the register map, all of which are read from that board's spec rather than configured here."
                },
                "rho.debug.engine": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "A debugger this machine has, when the board's own is not the one wanted: `gdb` for the built-in GDB/MI engine, or the name of one a plugin provides. Run **Rho: Debuggers Available** to see what this machine has. A plugin in `modules/plugins` declaring `extends: rho-dbg` adds one."
                },
                "rho.debug.svdFile": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "Where the chip's register map is, for a project that vendors its own CMSIS-SVD file. Leave empty to use the one the target spec names. Read by the peripheral view, and by a session that finds no map of its own."
                },
                "rho.debug.build": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": true,
                    "markdownDescription": "Whether a session builds the project before it starts. A launch configuration may say `build: false`; **one that says so is not built, which is what a person debugging a program they just flashed wants.**"
                },
                "rho.keeper.url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "",
                    "markdownDescription": "Where `rho keeper` serves the documentation, for language help. Leave empty for the dashboard's own default (`http://127.0.0.1:8477`); the extension starts a keeper there when one is not already running."
                }
            }
        },
        "commands": [
            {
                "command": "rho.showStatus",
                "title": "Show Toolchain Status",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.cliReference",
                "title": "CLI Reference",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.build",
                "title": "Build Project",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.run",
                "title": "Run File",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.test",
                "title": "Run Tests",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.doc",
                "title": "Generate Documentation",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.modules",
                "title": "Manage Modules",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.debug",
                "title": "Debug This Project",
                "category": "Rho",
                "icon": "$(debug-alt)"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.debug.attach",
                "title": "Attach to a Running Program",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.debug.setup",
                "title": "Configure Editor for This Project",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.debug.engines",
                "title": "Debuggers Available",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.clean",
                "title": "Clean Project",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.flash",
                "title": "Flash Board",
                "category": "Rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.peripherals.refresh",
                "title": "Refresh Peripherals",
                "category": "Rho",
                "icon": "$(refresh)"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.syntaxHelp",
                "title": "Language Help for the Word Here",
                "category": "Rho"
            }
        ],
        "menus": {
            "editor/title": [
                {
                    "command": "rho.debug",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "navigation@1"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.build",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "navigation@2"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.doc",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "navigation@3"
                }
            ],
            "editor/context": [
                {
                    "command": "rho.run",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "navigation@1"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.debug",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "navigation@2"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.test",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "1_rho"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.clean",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "1_rho"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.flash",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "1_rho"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.doc",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "2_rho"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.syntaxHelp",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "2_rho"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.modules",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "2_rho"
                },
                {
                    "command": "rho.debug.setup",
                    "when": "editorLangId == rho",
                    "group": "9_rho"
                }
            ],
            "view/title": [
                {
                    "command": "rho.peripherals.refresh",
                    "when": "view == rho.peripherals",
                    "group": "navigation"
                }
            ]
        },
        "keybindings": [
            {
                "command": "rho.debug",
                "key": "f5",
                "when": "editorLangId == rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.debug.attach",
                "key": "shift+f5",
                "when": "editorLangId == rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.build",
                "key": "ctrl+alt+b",
                "mac": "cmd+alt+b",
                "when": "editorLangId == rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.clean",
                "key": "ctrl+alt+shift+b",
                "mac": "cmd+alt+shift+b",
                "when": "editorLangId == rho"
            },
            {
                "command": "rho.flash",
                "key": "ctrl+alt+f",
                "mac": "cmd+alt+f",
                "when": "editorLangId == rho"
            }
        ],
        "debuggers": [
            {
                "type": "rho",
                "label": "Rho",
                "languages": [
                    "rho",
                    "c"
                ],
                "configurationAttributes": {
                    "launch": {
                        "required": [],
                        "properties": {
                            "program": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "The built program. Filled in from the project when not given."
                            },
                            "target": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "The board, as its target spec names it. Its spec says which debugger and which probe reach it."
                            },
                            "engine": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "A debugger this machine has. Empty means the board's own, or GDB."
                            },
                            "svdFile": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "The chip's register map, for a project that vendors its own."
                            },
                            "serverpath": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "The probe server, when this machine has it somewhere unusual."
                            },
                            "cwd": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Where the session runs.",
                                "default": "${workspaceFolder}"
                            },
                            "build": {
                                "type": "boolean",
                                "description": "Whether to build before starting.",
                                "default": true
                            },
                            "stopAtEntry": {
                                "type": "boolean",
                                "description": "Whether to stop before the program's first line.",
                                "default": false
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "attach": {
                        "required": [],
                        "properties": {
                            "program": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "The built program, loaded for its symbols."
                            },
                            "target": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "The board to attach to."
                            },
                            "cwd": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Where the session runs.",
                                "default": "${workspaceFolder}"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "initialConfigurations": [
                    {
                        "name": "Debug this project",
                        "type": "rho",
                        "request": "launch",
                        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}",
                        "build": true
                    }
                ],
                "configurationSnippets": [
                    {
                        "label": "Rho: debug a board",
                        "description": "Debug a board named by its target spec, with its own debugger and probe.",
                        "body": {
                            "name": "Debug ${1:target}",
                            "type": "rho",
                            "request": "launch",
                            "program": "^\"\\${workspaceFolder}/build/output/${2:app}\"",
                            "target": "$1",
                            "cwd": "^\"\\${workspaceFolder}\"",
                            "preLaunchTask": "rho: build",
                            "build": true
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "viewsContainers": {
            "activitybar": [
                {
                    "id": "rho",
                    "title": "Rho",
                    "icon": "media/rho.svg"
                }
            ]
        },
        "views": {
            "rho": [
                {
                    "id": "rho.peripherals",
                    "name": "Peripherals",
                    "contextualTitle": "Peripherals"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "scripts": {
        "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile",
        "compile": "tsc -p ./",
        "watch": "tsc -watch -p ./",
        "package": "vsce package"
    },
    "devDependencies": {
        "@types/vscode": "^1.80.0",
        "@types/node": "^18.0.0",
        "typescript": "^5.0.0",
        "vsce": "^2.15.0"
    },
    "dependencies": {
        "vscode-languageclient": "^9.0.0",
        "vscode-languageserver-protocol": "^3.17.0"
    },
    "activationEvents": [
        "onLanguage:rho",
        "onDebugResolve:rho",
        "workspaceContains:**/module.yml"
    ]
}
